check_strip_team5.py: a real Team 5 LanguageModel saved by Team 7's Checkpointer (make_lab_store.py, the frozen
p1536 tokenizer e6b93a93a60520d7b1af2e9242485f443b5596a1e116b8f8798d83bbad25a64b, Team 4's raw_table_P32.npz), stripped
and checked against export_safetensors(), the strict load into a fresh model and the saved probe bits. No benchmark item
is read: equal tensors in the same model class give equal scores.

Arms: teams/05-architecture/configs/arms/dryrun2.yaml (dry run 2's arm: KAS v2 head, 16 experts, top 2) and t2.yaml, each
at full depth (8 layers) and with --n-layer 2. 2 commits each (AdamW steps between, the last with reason "final").
Where: Linux (Docker python:3.11-slim, 16 GB VM), torch 2.15.0+cpu, lm_eval 0.4.13, kronecker-embeddings d07cb543.

Command:
  python teams/09-evaluation/harness_lab/tests/check_strip_team5.py --arm teams/05-architecture/configs/arms/<arm>.yaml \
      --tokenizer <p1536 tokenizer.json> --work <empty dir> [--n-layer 2]

